==Battleground==
*1 [[Croco]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~8 seconds<sup>90f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~8 seconds<sup>90f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
At the start of the battle, spawn [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]. When each set dies, replace it, then keep upgrading your [[Worker Cat]] until it has reached its maximum level. Then spawn a [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and meatshields. Fire the [[Cat Cannon]] when the army of Crocos appears and you should win.

