==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Aichi Prefecture'''.
*The gold statue on Aichi Prefecture's base is a [[wikipedia:Shachihoko|''shachi'']], a mythical creature with the head of a tiger, the body of a carp or dolphin, and control over rain. Two gold ''shachi'' adorn the roof of [[wikipedia:Nagoya Castle|Nagoya Castle]] in Nagoya, Aichi.

